{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04377","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍苍丁零塞，今古缅荒途。\n亭堠何摧兀，暴骨无全躯。\n黄沙幕南起，白日隐西隅。\n汉甲三十万，曾以事匈奴。\n但见沙场死，谁怜塞上孤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}